{
    "@visokiotype": "CustomBlockSchema.CustomBlockManifest",
    "name": "Investment Appraisal",
    "scriptFilename": "script.py",
    "language": "PYTHON",
    "executableVersion": null,
    "minVersions": [
        null
    ],
    "optionsVersion": 1,
    "apiVersion": "VERSION_0",
    "isResourceIntensiveScript": false,
    "showPartitioning": false,
    "icon": "data:image/png;base64,",
    "description": "NPV, IRR / XIRR, MIRR, payback, discounted payback and profitability index per project from cash flows, with NPV profiles and multiple-IRR warnings.",
    "category": "Analytics",
    "subcategory": "Finance",
    "tags": [
        "NPV",
        "IRR",
        "XIRR",
        "MIRR",
        "payback",
        "capital budgeting",
        "business case",
        "discounted cash flow",
        "visokio-agents"
    ],
    "introductoryText": "Compares **projects, capital requests or business cases** from their cash flows.\n\n- **NPV** at the discount rate (one rate for all, or a rate field per project)\n- **IRR** (or **XIRR** on actual dates) and **MIRR** (finance and reinvestment at the discount rate)\n- **Payback** and **discounted payback**, interpolated within the period\n- **Profitability index** (PV of inflows / PV of outflows), totals, rank by NPV and an accept / reject flag\n- Projects whose cash flows change sign more than once can have **several IRRs**: they are flagged and all IRRs found are listed\n\nTiming is by **period number** (0 = now, 1 = end of year 1...) or by **date** (XNPV / XIRR: annual rate, actual days / 365, discounted to each project's first date). Several rows for the same project and time are added together.\n\nOutputs: one row per project, the discounted cash flows with cumulative totals, and an **NPV profile** (NPV at rates from 0% to the maximum) for charts.",
    "dependencies": "",
    "options": [
        {
            "name": "project_field",
            "title": "Project field",
            "description": "Names the project each cash flow belongs to.",
            "groupTitle": null,
            "width": "ONE",
